{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/28211-looking-for-players-1-3-for-new-solar-game","id":28211,"title":"Looking for players! 1-3 for new solar game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-11T12:41:28-08:00","id":28211,"title":"Looking for players! 1-3 for new solar game","content":"Our gaming group just started a new game, and one of the players had to drop out. Now we need a few more.<br /> <br /> This is a straightforward 2.5 Solar game (which, oddly enough, even though we're all pretty experienced with Exalted, none of us have ever played!)<br /> <br /> So far we have the GM, a neurotic, combat-heavy Night caste, and a cheerful Zenith with imperialist tendencies.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the interest!<br /> <br /> Edit: Its 2.5/errata. We voice chat over skype, and use roll20 for maps and dice. The ST is on the east coast, the other 2 players are PST. There's not a set game time yet, because we're still ironing out schedules.<br /> <br /> We've had exactly one session, so there's not much of a backstory to tell. Its set about 50 years after the core books, but no major changes to the world - anathema are slightly more well known, and we're expanded the number of solaroids in the world. The action so far is in the east, just north of Lookshy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1634,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1634-sareteni","user":"sareteni","date":". 12-11-2013, 04:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1634-sareteni","name":"sareteni","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T13:15:39-08:00","id":28240,"title":"","content":"How and over what medium do you play, when do you play, and what system do you use?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T13:17:19-08:00","id":28242,"title":"","content":"You're going to have to mention a few other things there mate.<br /> <br /> - Day and time the game takes place.<br /> <br /> - Possible background information, unless you started literally one or two sessions ago and nothing major happened. You still may want to mention any obvious major plot changes (Like Empress being still around for example).<br /> <br /> - Possible location of Creation the game is taking place in (North, West, Blessed Isle, etc...)<br /> <br /> - Houserules, if any.<br /> <br /> I don't want to join the game, but in my experience these are the questions people always ask first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T13:37:19-08:00","id":28257,"title":"","content":"Yeah it would be kind of neat to know if you're looking for some dude who lives near Citytown, Stateland, or playing via Skype every mardi at 10 AM Tokyo time, or playing play-by-post etc.<br /> Because if you post it like this I'd say &quot;sure, I'm in, we can all fit in my place, I got a huge living room. You guys are near Berlin, right?&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T13:45:49-08:00","id":28267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/28211-looking-for-players-1-3-for-new-solar-game?p=28240#post28240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How and over what medium do you play, when do you play, and what system do you use?</div> </div> </div> </div>I knew I forgot something &gt;&gt;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","name":"Sandact6","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1183_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T13:47:39-08:00","id":28272,"title":"","content":"Its 2.5/errata. We voice chat over skype, and use roll20 for maps and dice. The ST is on the east coast, the other 2 players are PST. There's not a set game time yet, because we're still ironing out schedules.<br /> <br /> We've had exactly one session, so there's not much of a backstory to tell. Its set about 50 years after the core books, but no major changes to the world - anathema are slightly more well known, and we're expanded the number of solaroids in the world. The action so far is in the east, just north of Lookshy.<br /> <br /> House Rules: none that I can think of, but Im also not the ST.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1634-sareteni","name":"sareteni","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T14:09:40-08:00","id":28295,"title":"","content":"I would be game if the game was on weekends or weekday evenings, I am also on EST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/841-okamigrif","name":"Okamigrif","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T17:50:16-08:00","id":28419,"title":"","content":"I am on CST, and I'd be down for playing a Twilight or an Eclipse caste.<br /> <br /> However, I do run/play games Saturday evenings IRL and I have a constantly changing work schedule. I've also never played via a Skype game.<br /> <br /> But if you're willing to put up with me, I'd be more than happy to join.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T04:07:53-08:00","id":28618,"title":"","content":"I'm interested, but I'm GMT, and I can't play if the game ends up being scheduled close to midnight my time. I've got ideas for a social-fu, merchant Twilight that might fit, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;No boom<i> today</i>. Boom<i> tomorrow</i>. There's always a boom tomorrow. What? Look, somebodys got to have some damn perspective around here. Boom. Sooner or later. Boom!&quot; - Susan Ivanova","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/888-thatblueguy","name":"ThatBlueGuy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar888_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T04:35:05-08:00","id":28628,"title":"","content":"I'm interested. I do wonder if I could use firearms charms though...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/238-hammerofheaven","name":"HammerofHeaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar238_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T05:43:40-08:00","id":28656,"title":"","content":"It might be worth exploring the idea of a GMT/CET game either way...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/653-cecelyne","name":"Cecelyne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar653_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T08:56:28-08:00","id":28753,"title":"","content":"I can do weekdays(nights), especially friday.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T10:53:40-08:00","id":28813,"title":"","content":"...What the heck, I can at least find out if the timing will work. My working schedule can be kind of irregular and unpredictable, but in general, I have a game Saturday morning (EST) and my most common working days are Friday and Saturday evenings.<br /> <br /> Edit: Characterwise, I'd probably pull out one of the concepts I backstoried <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/3205-exaltation-stories\">here</a>, depending what'd be the best fit for the party and what people were interested in seeing around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I\u00e4! I\u00e4! Moe fthagn!","edited":{"userid":280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","user":"Valles","date":". 12-12-2013, 07:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/280-valles","name":"Valles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar280_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"677"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T15:07:46-08:00","id":28955,"title":"","content":"I'm down for it. Not sure if time conflicts will ensue? Still, so long as I have nothing else (tabletops or otherwise) going on at the time I can usually manage. Flexible schedule and all. Hit me up with a pm if interested/nobody else you prefer more can make it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/731-lurker","name":"Lurker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar731_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}